WEBVTT

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.790
So this is the inside of your dream.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:57.820
My!

00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:00.930
Aren't guests even served
a cup of tea around here?

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:04.430
Anyone rude enough to enter another's 
dream without her permission

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:05.790
cannot be called a guest.

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:10.500
Not to mention using powers
that you have stolen is despicable.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:13.290
Oh, dear, pardon me!

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.540
Perhaps I should have at least knocked.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:16.250
So?

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.340
What brings you here?

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:23.350
Shinku, fight with me 
for our Rosa Mysticas.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.960
One-on-one, naturally.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.320
What are you up to?

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:32.050
That was our original purpose, remember?

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:34.690
In order to end the Alice Game...

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:38.180
...one must collect 
all the Rosa Mysticas.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.530
Once I have defeated you...

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:43.540
...the rest are defective 
good-for-nothings.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:44.800
Similarly for you,

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.230
I would think that defeating me

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.140
will make things easier
 for you in the long run.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:51.240
Of course,

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.650
I would not be so boorish
as to demand that we do this right now.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.150
Tomorrow at midnight...

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.650
I will be waiting for 
you in the N Field.

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:01.920
You'll come, won't you?

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.210
As self-serving as ever, aren't you?

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:07.660
This is for the sake of meeting Father.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.630
I would do anything.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.130
All right.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:16.500
Then tomorrow at midnight...

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.610
In the N Field.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:22.580
I will be waiting for you then.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.360
Don't be late.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:39.490
Parting

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.730
Yay! Jun climbing!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.100
Get off me!
 You're so annoying!

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.740
No! Hina's gonna play with Jun!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:56.070
Darn it, when did this turn 
into a daycare center?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.800
Sheesh!

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:00.810
What?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.360
Just thinking it's unusual.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:07.310
Normally, you'd be like,
"It's too early for this," and get mad.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:10.820
Well, a lively atmosphere
isn't so bad once in a while.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.670
Wow...

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:15.730
Gack, that little...

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.190
Just in the nick of time!

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:33.580
Good morning!

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:38.830
I figured you would have time to kill anyway,
so I came all this way just to visit you.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.580
The least you can do is hurry up
and serve some tea!

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:44.330
Could she have done that on purpose?

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.430
I wouldn't put it past her...

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.390
Are you alone?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.880
Souseiseki is coming too!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.580
Sakurada-san...

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.730
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:05.280
Souseiseki, over here!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.010
Okay!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.010
Be right there!

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.690
Like this and like this...

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.800
I'll draw lots of flowers,

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.850
and turn
Jun's room into a flower garden!

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.830
This is a beautiful tea service.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:22.990
See here, human!

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:24.610
We have run out of sweets!

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.090
Hurry up and bring some!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.260
If you want some, go get it yourself.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.330
Hina wants to eat soft rice cakes
with strawberries!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.240
A cup of roasted tea.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:33.890
I'll have Darjeeling.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.070
This is a nightmare.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.570
The doll population is greater
than the human one.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.350
Jun-kun, please help me out!

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:43.560
Darn it all!

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.850
What do you want?

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:49.970
See, I ended up as a volunteer to be in
a play at the local kindergarten...

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:52.850
...but I'm not getting 
anywhere practicing alone.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:54.420
Not my problem!

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.860
That's got
nothing to do with me!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.360
Don't say that!
 Please help me!

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.580
I only need you to practice 
with me for a bit!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:01.740
No way!

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:02.430
Jun.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:07.100
Jun, you should work a 
little more for others.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.860
Yes, indeed! 
Work, you youngster!

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:12.580
Hina will work too!

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:13.940
Do you know what you're saying?

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:15.440
You guys shut up!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.380
Please, you're my only hope.

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:33.800
Heigh-ho, heigh-ho, 
we're inside the forest here.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:39.450
We sing and dance with Snow White,
and every day is fun.

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:42.990
There aren't seven of us,
but we're the seven dwarves!

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:45.300
Come on, Souseiseki, smile! Smile!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:46.700
Like this?

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.010
No! More like this!

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:53.910
"And thus surrounded by the bright and
cheerful dwarves, Snow White..."

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:55.010
Hold on!

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:58.000
If it's narration, you can practice
that on your own!

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:02.060
But it's impossible to match up
the timing and stuff alone.

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.380
It's not Hina's turn yet!

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.890
Snow White-san, come over here!

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:09.890
This was not what I intended.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:14.130
You're more of a red-caped phantom
than Snow White.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:17.380
That's what you get for laughing.

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:21.750
Come on now, Snow White-san
shouldn't look so prickly.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.540
You have to laugh and sing with us!

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:30.450
Sometimes she's a little scary,

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:34.160
but she's actually a kind princess!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:38.320
The cute Snow White wearing all red!

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.770
Isn't that Shinku you're talking about?

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:41.900
It doesn't matter.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:43.150
Right, Shinku?

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.290
This was not what I intended,
but I see no helping it.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:50.300
SNOW WHITE

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:50.300
Thus, Snow White led a happy life
with the dwarves.

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:52.350
However, an evil, old witch

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:57.670
who wasjealous of
 Snow White's beauty, appeared!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.940
I don't understand!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:03.180
Why is Suiseiseki cast 
as the mean, old woman?

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.420
You ask why, but...

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.850
It's perfect!

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:08.780
It would be unthinkable 
to cast anyone else.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.920
Yeah, I think it fits you.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.820
My! Souseiseki, not you too!

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.010
All right then.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.830
If you insist that much,
 I will play her brilliantly!

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:25.800
If I just make Snow White eat this apple,
it'll be the end of her!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.560
She's scary...

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:31.370
What a convincing performance.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:33.810
No, I don't think it's a performance...

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.040
You there, lovely young lady...

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:39.160
how would you like a sweet
and strangely delicious apple?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.320
This was not what I intended,
but I will take it.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.410
Oh, look what's happened 
to Snow White-san!

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:52.930
Princess!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.310
Serves her right!

00:08:57.630 --> 00:09:02.770
Now the most beautiful woman
in the world is me, Suiseiseki!

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:05.980
Hang on!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.000
Open your eyes!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:07.960
It's no use.

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.110
With the witch's poison, 
Snow White has...

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.950
Is Shinku dead?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.410
Shinku!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.580
Um, so, it's not Shinku.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:22.250
Right then, a prince on
a white horse came along.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:27.260
Only the prince's kiss
can erase the witch's poison.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:29.930
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.870
What? I have to kiss her?

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:37.360
That's right!

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.360
You're the prince, Jun!

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.440
Now, kiss Snow White.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.140
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.720
Like hell I can do that!

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.390
She's a doll!

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:48.640
Kissing her is...

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:50.500
Kissing her is like...

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:04.600
What was that for?

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:08.500
If the story ends here,
I will have had far too few scenes!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.040
There should definitely be a big battle between
 the prince and the witch in the second half!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:13.260
Why you!

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:15.910
Do you even know
the story of Snow White?

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:19.500
All you ever do is say whatever you feel like,
you demonic doll!

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.810
What did you call me?

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:24.510
I won't take that from 
a puny, four-eyed geek!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.620
Whoa, stop it!

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.850
Yay! Hina's gonna jump in too!

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:32.360
Oh, the practice is a mess.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.010
Why are you joining in?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:31.940
Quit it!

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:37.390
Jun, you missed your chance.

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:39.820
What are you talking about?

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:43.320
I would've gotten nothing 
out of kissing a doll!

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:44.500
You! You! Take this, you!

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:44.500
Really. That's too bad.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:45.600
Huh?

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:48.540
Hey, you can't let your guard down!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.230
That's it!

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.160
Get down on your knees
and bow down in submission!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.410
You foolish, chibi human!

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:55.720
I've had it.

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:56.820
Shinku.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.360
All of you, get out!

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:59.130
What's wrong?

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:00.650
It's nothing.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:03.890
Quit it!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.090
Why you! 
Cut it out already!

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.890
You'll pay for this!

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.510
Sheesh!

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:24.340
At this rate, I feel like they'll
take over the whole house.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.840
Oh, what's the matter?

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.170
Why are they dressed like that?

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:45.360
I thought after all the running,
we should do some laundry.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.760
Do that kind of thing behind
a locked door, all right?

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.130
I'm a guy, you know!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:53.190
Jun was all red, right up to his ears.

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.090
What was he so embarrassed about?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.590
Well, it just means he's a kid
when all's said and done.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:11:59.740
Huh.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.200
Shinku, I'll wash yours later
to avoid staining the others.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:08.700
Round and round and round and round.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.150
It's spinning!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.420
Look, bubble-bubbles!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.940
Now you've done it!

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.340
Bubbles everywhere!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.300
Hey, stop that!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.970
What are they doing?

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:37.820
Once Hina and the others' laundry is done,
I'll wash yours right away too.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:40.410
What about Jun's?

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:46.420
Oh, he said he'd have it in his room,
so I just took it to him earlier.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:51.660
Tell me, Nori.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.980
Is it all right for matters 
to remain as they are?

00:12:57.310 --> 00:13:00.580
Well, it would be bad if things
stayed the same, right?

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:06.490
How would you like another cup of tea?

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:29.620
I'm sure he needs some 
kind of small trigger.

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:33.830
I understand that, but I don't
know what I should do.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:36.720
I'm so stupid I hate it.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.840
You're exactly right.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:43.270
After all, you still cannot make
a proper cup of tea.

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:44.340
And it's lukewarm.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:49.770
Oh, I knew it, but it makes me sad
to be told that upfront anyway.

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:51.140
Listen to me, Nori.

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:54.730
Tea leaves are a very delicate thing.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:58.510
Each kind has an appropriate
method of preparation.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:03.330
An erroneous method
can draw out the wrong answer.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.830
The wrong answer?

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:06.830
Yes.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:11.810
Earlier, you poured hot water in a cup
before putting it in the pot.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:15.340
That causes the water to cool,
and the tea will not be flavorful.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:16.810
I see.

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:19.840
So the same method as 
green tea won't work.

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:21.840
I didn't know that.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.350
It's a small difference.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:28.350
Warming the cup is an 
act of consideration.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:32.350
But there are times when
that is and is not correct.

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:36.860
When you come to understand it,
I'm sure you'll find it's a small thing.

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:42.100
The laundry should be done now.

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:44.830
Okay, let's hang them out to dry
and get Shinku's clothes...

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.560
What is this?

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:50.940
Bubble-bubbles!

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:53.530
We're all covered in bubbles!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.350
And whose fault is that?

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:11.810
What am I getting worked up about?

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.270
They're dolls!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:15.000
Incredibly difficult dolls at that!

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:16.500
What are you talking about?

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:18.970
What?

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:20.230
You want something?

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:22.770
The cuffs here are about to come off.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:23.910
Sew it back on for me.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:25.010
Huh?

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:28.480
Nori told me that it would fall off
if it was laundered as is.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:29.830
That's not it.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:32.420
You could just ask her to 
do something like that.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.660
What an annoying servant, 
always complaining.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:37.730
If you wish, I will seal 
your mouth with a curse.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.480
Oh, all right.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.620
I just have to do it, right?

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:42.820
Exactly.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:43.870
Then please do it.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:58.570
What?

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:00.870
Nothing really...

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:02.970
Come on, hurry up and hand it over.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:04.580
"Please hand it to me," right?

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.060
What about something else to wear?

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:11.370
Should I be in my underwear
till the laundry is done?

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.810
All right.

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:13.990
Hold on a second.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:23.460
Wow, what fine weather!

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.470
It's nice and warm.

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:28.090
Hurry up and kneel down!

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:31.470
What kind of dream is she having?

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:57.390
What is it?

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:00.150
This isn't interesting to watch.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:01.370
Yes, it is.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.910
No, it's not.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.370
Yes, it is.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:05.830
Very.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.870
Those fingers must be magical fingers.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:13.610
Soon, you'll even be able to sew
a robe fit for a princess.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:16.900
You sure blow things out of proportion.

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:19.900
What have you been looking 
at all this time?

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.880
Are my ball joints so novel?

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:24.620
Not really.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:29.550
It's just that I forgot for a bit
that you guys were black magic dolls.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.630
When I wind down...

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:34.640
...this is what becomes stiff first.

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:37.880
And then I grow very sleepy.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:41.070
It is a very deep sleep.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.640
Does that mean you die?

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:50.670
No.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:54.180
We merely sleep for a bit
while we are wound down.

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:59.940
But if no one winds us up...

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:03.140
we may continue to slumber
and never awaken.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.800
That's the kind of sleep it is.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:10.900
That sounds sort of nice.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.300
Why?

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:16.170
There'd be no one who knew me
by the time I woke up.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.450
I bet that would be refreshing.

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:21.440
I almost wouldn't mind never waking up.

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:23.780
Do you think so?

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:26.710
I think it's better to wake up.

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:33.120
For Rozen Maidens, awakening also
signals the start of battle...

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:38.190
but you see a lot more and hear more
awake than asleep.

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:43.500
And someday, you'll also 
get to meet Father.

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:45.660
When that happens,
 the Alice Game will end.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.740
You fight in order to 
end the Alice Game?

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:56.070
Alice is a girl who only exists
within Father's mind.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.760
A dream girl.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:04.140
Nobler than any flower, 
purer than any jewel...

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.770
Absolutely unspoiled.

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:11.490
A girl so sublimely beautiful that no girl
in the world could hold a candle to her.

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:16.640
His quest to give shape to that Alice
resulted in us,

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:18.580
the Rozen Maiden dolls.

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:23.490
But as he made one doll, then two...

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.200
No matter how many he 
made, it was no use.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:30.190
None of us measured up to Alice.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:35.120
But if we win the Alice Game
and collect all the Rosa Mysticas...

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.180
...we will be able to become Alice.

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.300
That's a sad story.

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:40.340
Is it?

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:41.670
Sure it is.

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:44.580
You were created and made to fight
for a reason like that...

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:47.020
What does he think you guys are?

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.910
It's too sad.

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:53.530
I do not think so.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:55.930
Because...

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:00.440
To live is to fight, isn't it?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:27.670
We can't, Jun-kun,
 you're my brother...

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:33.540
We ran about so much today
I'm really sleepy now.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:36.040
What is the matter?

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:39.340
Shinku was acting somewhat weird today.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.280
That one is always weird.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:44.860
Even among us sisters, 
she is especially weird.

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:46.240
Not like that.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.580
It was like
she was hiding something.

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:50.090
I just got this feeling...

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:51.420
What?

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:38.250
Farewell, Jun.

00:23:42.380 --> 00:23:45.990
It's the middle of the night.
Why isn't Shinku here?

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:48.580
Shall I tell you why?

00:23:48.580 --> 00:23:49.430
You!

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:51.380
Hey, what did you do to Shinku?

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:52.430
You will know soon enough.

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:55.210
Now, let us go together.

00:23:55.210 --> 00:23:57.930
To that doll you love so much.

00:23:58.640 --> 00:23:59.680
What...

00:23:59.680 --> 00:24:01.970
Shinku... Shinku!

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:04.340
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:07.500
Shinku, just you wait.

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:10.910
Chapter 11
Destiny
